WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.298 --> 00:00:01.913
- How did I come out to my grandmother?

00:00:01.913 --> 00:00:04.133
She asked me how many
bedrooms were in the apartment

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:07.495
I shared with my
ex-girlfriend and I said, one.

00:00:07.495 --> 00:00:10.078
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:11.987
She got it.

00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:18.906
Is your family accepting
of having your wife visit

00:00:18.906 --> 00:00:20.329
for the holidays?

00:00:20.329 --> 00:00:22.799
More like, is my wife accepting
of having my family visit

00:00:22.799 --> 00:00:23.812
for the holidays?

00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:25.363
'Cause I live with my wife.

00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:27.453
Also, my wife is my family.

00:00:27.453 --> 00:00:29.611
I'm not out to my
conservative Catholic parents

00:00:29.611 --> 00:00:31.581
but I really wanna wear
a tie to Thanksgiving

00:00:31.581 --> 00:00:35.642
'cause I've started to really
enjoy dressing androgynously.

00:00:35.642 --> 00:00:39.073
Is it a bad idea to dress so
obviously gay around them?

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:42.945
I don't know, I think dressing
obviously gay kinda rules.

00:00:42.945 --> 00:00:46.814
Not that straight women don't wear ties.

00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:47.897
Diane Keaton.

00:00:48.738 --> 00:00:50.556
I'm 35, so I know who that is.

00:00:50.556 --> 00:00:51.954
What is your favorite
part about going home

00:00:51.954 --> 00:00:52.787
for the holidays?

00:00:52.787 --> 00:00:53.620
Pie.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.729
I came out as trans around
this time last year.

00:00:56.729 --> 00:00:58.280
Oh hey, congrats.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.158
And although most of my
family is pretty supportive,

00:01:00.158 --> 00:01:01.869
they can ask awkward questions sometimes,

00:01:01.869 --> 00:01:04.386
specifically about when I'll
be getting certain surgeries.

00:01:04.386 --> 00:01:07.038
How can I let them this
is not their business

00:01:07.038 --> 00:01:08.620
without bringing down the mood?

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:09.453
Boo!

00:01:11.123 --> 00:01:12.247
That's to them, not you.

00:01:12.247 --> 00:01:13.715
Listen, that's your bod.

00:01:13.715 --> 00:01:16.217
And I assume you don't
ask whoever this is,

00:01:16.217 --> 00:01:19.731
cousins, uncles, your mom
and dad about their bod.

00:01:19.731 --> 00:01:21.437
Well, I don't know your family.

00:01:21.437 --> 00:01:22.966
If you draw a line in the sand

00:01:22.966 --> 00:01:24.501
because they're making you uncomfortable,

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:27.553
you are protecting your
mental and emotional safety,

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.562
and that's not bringing down the mood.

00:01:29.562 --> 00:01:31.069
What do you say when you're a lesbian

00:01:31.069 --> 00:01:33.578
but your family keeps asking
why you don't have a boyfriend?

00:01:33.578 --> 00:01:36.032
Distraction, bring up a different topic,

00:01:36.032 --> 00:01:37.976
something like Obamacare.

00:01:37.976 --> 00:01:39.441
Let them debate.

00:01:39.441 --> 00:01:42.271
What do I do if I've come
out to my mom five times

00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:45.224
and she still ignores the fact
that I've come out to her?

00:01:45.224 --> 00:01:46.057
At this point,

00:01:46.057 --> 00:01:48.618
you just have to proceed
as if she already knows,

00:01:48.618 --> 00:01:50.631
because she already knows.

00:01:50.631 --> 00:01:53.140
She's pretending she
doesn't, but she knows.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.841
Just talk to her like you
normally would about your life.

00:01:55.841 --> 00:01:58.964
I'm gay and I have family
members who voted for Trump.

00:01:58.964 --> 00:02:00.881
How do I not go insane?

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:03.499
Well, nothing brings joy to the holidays

00:02:03.499 --> 00:02:07.447
like a really stressful and
nearly devastating election.

00:02:07.447 --> 00:02:08.770
So, what do we do now?

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.703
You should let your family
know if a Trump presidency

00:02:11.703 --> 00:02:14.023
is upsetting to you.

00:02:14.023 --> 00:02:15.966
I called my parents before the election,

00:02:15.966 --> 00:02:18.270
I told them what was at stake for me,

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.077
and actually, they listened.

00:02:21.077 --> 00:02:23.875
So, there's hope, it's not too late.

00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:25.247
Overall, the holidays should be about

00:02:25.247 --> 00:02:28.218
celebration and relaxation.

00:02:28.218 --> 00:02:30.627
So, if the family that you were born into

00:02:30.627 --> 00:02:33.944
isn't that for you, take a friendsgiving,

00:02:33.944 --> 00:02:36.375
or rent some great movies.

00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:40.235
Go home and then play
my act for your family.

00:02:40.235 --> 00:02:44.402
Play this video, play this
video for your family.

